{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52249","headline":"诗（幷序） 十 · 王梵志","name":"诗（幷序） 十","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"撩乱失精神，无由见家里。\n妻是他人妻（一作「事」），儿被後翁使。\n驷马被金鞍，镂镫银秋辔。\n角弓无主张，宝剑抛着地。\n设却百日斋，浑家忘却你。\n钱财他人用，古来寻常事。\n前人多贮积，後人无惭愧。\n此是守财奴，不兑（张改作「免」）贫穷事。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52249.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52249","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}